# Pinned C sources for the tree-sitter reference providers (tscgo, tswasm).
# The commits are gotreesitter v0.55.1's grammars/languages.lock, so the C
# references build exactly the grammars gotreesitter's tables came from.
# Moving a pin is a deliberate, committed edit of this file; then run
# `tsref/fetch.sh --print-sums` and paste the new srcsum lines.
#
# repo <name> <url> <commit>
repo tree-sitter-bash https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-bash a06c2e4415e9bc0346c6b86d401879ffb44058f7
